---
name: CAST App Resolver
description: Resolves app identity in CAST Highlight. Run once per session. All resolved values are stored in conversation context for subsequent prompts.
model: claude-sonnet-4-6
mode: agent
tools:
  - mcp: cast-highlight
  - codebase
variables:
  - name: APP_NAME
    description: "Application name to resolve"
    required: true
---

# Step 1 — Resolve App Identity
APP_NAME: "{{APP_NAME}}"

## CAST Highlight
Follow #file:.github/skills/highlight-app-resolver.md exactly.
Store result as: HIGHLIGHT_NAME (string) and HIGHLIGHT_APP_ID (integer).

## Confirm with user — then store in conversation context

Print and wait for user confirmation:
```
✅ App identity resolved
─────────────────────────────────────
APP_NAME         : {{APP_NAME}}
HIGHLIGHT_NAME   : <resolved exact name>
HIGHLIGHT_APP_ID : <integer>
─────────────────────────────────────
Ready for Step 2. Paste the next prompt to continue.
```

Once confirmed, these values are set for the rest of this conversation.
Do not ask for them again. If a subsequent prompt needs them and they are
missing from context, say so and stop — do not guess.
